    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n107537" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπερήμῐσυς</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">υ,</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>above half, more than half,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπερημίσεες ἦσαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					7.40
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Γελῴων ὑπερημίσεας . . τὠυτὸ .
				. ἐποίησε</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				156
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄντες ὑπερημίσεις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Inscr.Prien.</u>
					28.30
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(ii B. C.)</span>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπερήμισυ</span>
			(or <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπὲρ ἥμισυ</span>)
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc"> τοῦ στρατεύματος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>An.</u>
					6.2.10
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χρηματιζόντωσαν ὑπερήμισυ γινόμενοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					42(1).68.74
				</span></i>
			 (Epid., <span class="entity">iv B. C.</span>).</div>
